BaseVault_setCrosschainVaults
├── when the caller does not have the CONFIG_OPERATOR_ROLE
│   └── it should revert
└── when the caller has the CONFIG_OPERATOR_ROLE
    ├── when the array is empty
    │   └── it should revert with BaseVault__EmptyInput
    ├── when the array lengths do not match
    │   └── it should revert
    ├── when a chain selector is zero
    │   └── it should revert with BaseVault__NoZeroChainSelector
    ├── when a vault is the zero address
    │   ├── it should remove the crosschain vault
    │   └── it should emit a CrosschainVaultSet event
    └── when the array lengths match
        ├── it should update s_crosschainVaults for each entry
        └── it should emit a CrosschainVaultSet event for each entry
